<title>SWEDEN: Skanska buys Swedish road company.</title>
<headline>Skanska buys Swedish road company.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish construction company Skanska AB said on Tuesday it had agreed to takeover a Swedish road company with an annual turnover of 430 million crowns from Geveko.  </p>
<p>The company that Skanska bought, called Gatu och Vag, is a highway and construction company with operations in central and western Sweden.</p>
<p>&quot;With the acquisition, Skanska complements and strengthens its position within the highway and construction sector,&quot; Skanska regional head Jan-Gunnar Glave said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
